      "kind": "instruction",
      "path": "/home/jhx/combination_coverage/results/failure_analysis/deepswe_failed_trials_n211_20261006/trials/arktype-json-schema-refs-depende__YZ3qE3T/instruction.md",
      "sha256": "594fa84b95c92f69e949de2781107a3ff5b6131e889203fc4505f6f41a136ea3",
      "bytes": 1993,
      "line_count": 30,
      "anchors": [
        {
          "line": 1,
          "text": "Expected Feature:"
        },
        {
          "line": 2,
          "text": "dependencies/dependentRequired: if trigger key present, require dependent keys."
        },
        {
          "line": 3,
          "text": "dependencies/dependentSchemas: if trigger key present, validate against schema."
        },
        {
          "line": 4,
          "text": "$ref: local #/$defs/<name> only, supports recursion and use in dependentSchemas."
        },
        {
          "line": 6,
          "text": "Error Message Requirements:"
        },
        {
          "line": 7,
          "text": "- Invalid ref format: \"Only local $ref values of the form #/$defs/<name> are supported\""
        },
        {
          "line": 8,
          "text": "- Non-existent ref: \"Unable to resolve $ref \\\"#/$defs/NonExistentDef\\\" from root $defs\""
        },
        {
          "line": 10,
          "text": "Note:"
        },
        {
          "line": 11,
          "text": "Ensure enum deep equality with object/array values"
        },
        {
          "line": 13,
          "text": "if/then/else conditional schemasSemantics:"
        },
        {
          "line": 14,
          "text": "- if: evaluate schema silently (no validation failure) against the data"
        },
        {
          "line": 15,
          "text": "- then: if 'if' matches, data must also validate against 'then'"
        },
        {
          "line": 16,
          "text": "- else: if 'if' does not match, data must validate against 'else'"
        },
        {
          "line": 17,
          "text": "- if alone (no then/else): valid no-op, imposes no constraints"
        },
        {
          "line": 18,
          "text": "- then/else without if: no-op (ignored)"
        },
        {
          "line": 19,
          "text": "- Applies to any JSON value type, not just objects"
        },
        {
          "line": 20,
          "text": "- Can nest: if/then/else inside then or else schemas"
        },
        {
          "line": 21,
          "text": "- Can be combined with type, properties, and all other keywords"
        },
        {
          "line": 22,
          "text": "- Can chain multiple conditions via allOf, each with their own if/then/else"
        },
        {
          "line": 23,
          "text": "- Supports $ref in any of the three schemas"
        },
        {
          "line": 24,
          "text": "- Supports boolean schemas (if: true always matches, if: false never matches)"
        },
        {
          "line": 26,
          "text": "Note:"
        },
        {
          "line": 27,
          "text": "- then/else schemas with properties/required but no explicit 'type' are rejected by the parser without implicit object schema detection: add a fallback in parseJsonSchema that treats schemas containing object keywords (properties, required, patternProperties, additionalProperties, maxProperties, min"
        },
        {
          "line": 28,
          "text": "- Recursive $ref inside anyOf composition can produce buggy results: ensure alias nodes are fully resolved before composition so that anyOf branches referencing $defs do not short-circuit or double-wrap the resolved type."
        },
        {
          "line": 30,
          "text": "IMPORTANT: Please work on this in a new branch from main and commit everything when you are done."
        }
      ]
    },
